\f1\fs22 Two days later the entire Elvi nation assembled in the same stadium Kleo, the Great Sage, had been cremated only a few months prior. The High Elvis called them to order and told of the threat to their nation which filled the crowd with fear and disquiet until he told them of the solution - The Humpening. The cheers took an age to die down. The volunteers, including the entire cabinet, lined up and were, male and female in turn, infected with the T-virus. After an hour or so each of them were contagious and ready to infect. They lined up across the southern end of the old sporting field and removed their clothing to reveal Elvi bodies in various stages of maturity and decay.\
\'93Now, not everyone can be inoculated at once. Wait your turn and no line jumping.\'94 the High Elvis wanted an orderly orgy, at least until he was finished. \'93Let the humpening begin!\'94 A deafening cheer was let out by the crowd and they began.\
the Great Teacher was there mainly out of interest and to watch the carnage unfold from the high in the stands. He thought he might lend a hand if necessary, but after a quiet start, a frenzy of fear, lust and urgency took over. Many Elvi, male and female alike, were burdened with multiple partners attacking from different angles, all at once. The Elvine\'92s and the Elvis\'92s were troopers, taking far more than just one for the team. Male Elvi searched the giant white stack of writhing cloned flesh for any orifice that might reasonably accept penetration. Quite a few ears, eyes, nose and throat specialists emerged from the pile that day.\
Disturbed beyond words, the Great Teacher quietly slid out of the stadium, ensuring his backside was firmly wedged up against the wall as he slowly made his way home, regretting dreadfully that he could never erase those memories. \
 The humpening lasted for several days of shocking debauchery, before it was certain all were infected with the T-virus and plumb tuckered out. Some suggested they make it a yearly event, but they were probably the lucky few who hadn\'92t been arse-fucked for three days solid.\

